Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.30,0:00:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.30,0:00:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:28.50,0:00:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:33.70,0:00:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下 {\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.40,0:00:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が {\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.80,0:00:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.00,0:00:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.30,0:01:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:10.60,0:01:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.70,0:01:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.10,0:01:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.70,0:01:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.10,0:01:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.90,0:01:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.70,0:01:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:53.60,0:01:55.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不會再被殺死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:56.40,0:01:57.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,消失吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:06.30,0:02:07.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不可以 小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:08.00,0:02:11.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手 不能憑感情殺人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.80,0:02:13.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐會被送下地獄的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.10,0:02:17.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那樣也無所謂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:17.80,0:02:21.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,糟了 內心被憎恨支配了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.10,0:02:39.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:45.10,0:02:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:52.30,0:02:53.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我無所謂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:55.60,0:02:58.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨 流向地獄就好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:16.70,0:03:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:23.60,0:03:24.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:26.70,0:03:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:42.80,0:03:44.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,阿一 我好難受
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:45.90,0:03:48.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:19.50,0:04:21.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你醒了啊 仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.10,0:04:26.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,飯糰已經做好了 喫吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:29.80,0:04:30.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,草鞋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.00,0:04:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你又幫別人做了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.40,0:04:37.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這種事爸爸你根本不用做啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:37.80,0:04:38.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒關係
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:39.10,0:04:41.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那你至少收點錢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.00,0:04:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,行了 喫吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:43.10,0:04:44.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:44.40,0:04:45.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我身體不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:46.00,0:04:48.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,幹農活又總是給村裏添麻煩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:49.40,0:04:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這也就當作是謝謝大家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.70,0:04:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喫吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:01.60,0:05:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喫完了我來幫你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.10,0:05:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不用 你去玩吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:05.30,0:05:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,剛纔小愛來過了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.20,0:05:09.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看你在睡覺就說等會兒再來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:11.60,0:05:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今天就算了 幫您做草鞋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:14.70,0:05:15.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,去陪她玩吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:16.70,0:05:20.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能陪小愛玩的除了你這表兄就沒有別人了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.90,0:05:21.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:24.40,0:05:24.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:27.80,0:05:29.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了 又被人欺負了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:30.30,0:05:34.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是誰 是耕吉嗎 那個混蛋
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.30,0:05:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎 等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.90,0:05:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,回來 仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:40.90,0:05:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那個傻瓜
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:45.90,0:05:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,耕吉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:48.10,0:05:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你幹什麼 仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.70,0:05:51.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住嘴 是他把小愛弄哭了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:51.90,0:05:54.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,傻瓜 那個傢伙可是妖怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:54.40,0:05:56.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你那麼護着她是想幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:56.40,0:05:58.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也知道吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:58.40,0:06:01.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有她在就會有可怕的事情發生
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:01.30,0:06:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,昨天她把死去的蝴蝶放在手上它就活過來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.40,0:06:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是妖怪的力量 不會錯的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:07.90,0:06:08.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,閉嘴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.80,0:06:11.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村裏的人們也覺得害怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:11.50,0:06:15.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只要愛在村裏一定會倒大黴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:15.80,0:06:17.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以讓她消失吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:18.00,0:06:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了村子消失吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:20.00,0:06:21.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:24.00,0:06:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,護着愛的傢伙不是村裏的夥伴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:27.30,0:06:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,打他
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:45.90,0:06:46.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:49.80,0:06:52.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那蝴蝶還沒死 所以…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:53.30,0:06:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別在意那些傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:00.90,0:07:02.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:08.50,0:07:08.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,給
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:12.90,0:07:13.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:15.10,0:07:17.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我可不覺得你是妖怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:19.50,0:07:20.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,小愛就是小愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:44.10,0:07:49.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,今晚你們的女兒將爲了今後七年的五穀豐登
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.30,0:07:51.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,獻給山神
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:51.70,0:07:53.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是非常光榮的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:54.80,0:07:55.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,非常的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.80,0:08:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家都在神社等着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.20,0:08:02.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,準備好了就過來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:08.60,0:08:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼是小愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.00,0:08:13.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲小愛是妖怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:14.20,0:08:16.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲你們這麼想 對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:17.40,0:08:18.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:19.60,0:08:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,因爲感到害怕 希望她消失
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.50,0:08:24.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以把小愛選作送七的巫女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:24.90,0:08:25.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你說什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:26.40,0:08:28.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,大家只是希望把小愛趕出去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:28.90,0:08:29.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:30.70,0:08:32.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼你把能代替她的人帶來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:32.80,0:08:34.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你做得到嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:44.50,0:08:45.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那是爲了村子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.90,0:08:48.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們在外面等 快點吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:59.00,0:08:59.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.90,0:09:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,有事情拜託你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:25.00,0:09:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼 帶着淨化的身心去山神那兒吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:46.00,0:09:47.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:50.70,0:09:53.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼做給村裏的人知道的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:53.90,0:09:55.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也幫幫忙吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:57.30,0:10:05.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,想到山神的憤怒 我也知道那事是不能做的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:05.50,0:10:05.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:06.90,0:10:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託了 仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:08.50,0:10:10.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣下去小愛就太可憐了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:11.30,0:10:13.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,拜託你了 保護愛吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.30,0:10:14.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可是…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:17.80,0:10:18.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:25.00,0:10:27.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快點快點 冷死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:29.60,0:10:30.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:31.70,0:10:33.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我會保護小愛的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:13.60,0:11:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,還是不妙啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:15.60,0:11:17.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,晴天太少了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:18.70,0:11:20.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼回事呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:21.00,0:11:24.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有好好向山神祈禱了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:31.40,0:11:33.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不好意思 今晚也拜託你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:58.40,0:11:58.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.40,0:12:10.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我把換洗的衣服和喫的帶來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:11.00,0:12:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:44.00,0:12:45.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好嚴重
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:45.70,0:12:47.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,湊在一起也不夠交年貢的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:48.60,0:12:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼辦 爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:50.10,0:12:53.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只有用倉庫的幹粟米湊數了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:54.20,0:12:56.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那麼做的話我們喫什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:59.30,0:13:01.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,最近一直都是這個樣子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.80,0:13:02.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是餓壞了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:03.00,0:13:04.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒辦法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:04.40,0:13:06.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,她媽沒奶水啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:07.30,0:13:08.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,好可憐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:08.90,0:13:12.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那樣可能撐不過這個冬天吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.00,0:13:22.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,櫻樹之花 何時綻放
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:23.50,0:13:28.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山麓莊中 何時綻放
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:29.10,0:13:34.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,櫻樹之花 何時芬芳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:35.50,0:13:40.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七子顏笑 玩耍時常
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.10,0:13:46.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,櫻樹之花 何時飄蕩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.60,0:13:52.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七子詠歌 沉入夢鄉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:53.20,0:13:58.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,櫻樹之花 何時凋亡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:59.90,0:14:05.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七子逝去 魂昇天上
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:16.20,0:14:17.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嚇死我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:17.50,0:14:18.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我也是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:28.60,0:14:29.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:32.80,0:14:35.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣的月夜溜出祠堂不要緊嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:36.30,0:14:37.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒事的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:37.40,0:14:40.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村裏人腦子裏全是收成的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.60,0:14:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,是嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:42.60,0:14:43.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,舒服嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:45.60,0:14:46.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:49.60,0:14:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,月亮好美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:56.20,0:14:56.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一直…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:59.90,0:15:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,能一直這樣就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:03.00,0:15:03.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:15.00,0:15:17.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,一起離開村子吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:19.70,0:15:21.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒什麼 真的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:23.80,0:15:24.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真奇怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:30.10,0:15:32.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎 你幹了什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:34.40,0:15:35.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:35.90,0:15:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,流言都傳開了 說你每天晚上進山裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:41.70,0:15:42.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這樣什麼都清楚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:43.30,0:15:46.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,莊稼沒有收成就是因爲她違反了規矩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:47.60,0:15:49.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,招來了山神的憤怒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:50.00,0:15:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村裏的人現在都餓成什麼樣子了 你有沒有想過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:54.40,0:15:57.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛 你這樣的女孩不能原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:58.40,0:16:00.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快逃 愛 逃啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:00.40,0:16:01.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別想逃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:01.70,0:16:02.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.70,0:16:05.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:07.30,0:16:09.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放開我 爸爸 放開我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:10.10,0:16:11.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,抓住她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:11.50,0:16:12.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別讓她跑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:14.80,0:16:15.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:23.10,0:16:25.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,救命 仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:25.90,0:16:26.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:26.90,0:16:27.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,可惡
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:27.90,0:16:28.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:35.60,0:16:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我真恨自己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:39.10,0:16:40.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明明想救小姐
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:41.40,0:16:43.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,真的發生了事情卻什麼都做不到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.50,0:16:49.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,沒有被小姐收容 我們差點就爛在地獄裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:51.30,0:16:53.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們欠小姐個大人情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:54.30,0:16:55.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,到底去哪兒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:56.80,0:17:00.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難道真的下地獄了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:00.40,0:17:02.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,哎 冷靜一點
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:02.90,0:17:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,慌張也是沒有辦法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.80,0:17:07.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,要說世事只有順其自然
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:15.60,0:17:16.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放開我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:16.40,0:17:17.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,放開我 爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:17.50,0:17:20.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,別動 待着聽我說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:18.00,0:17:20.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這麼下去 愛她 愛她
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:21.60,0:17:22.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,聽我說 仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:24.20,0:17:27.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你也幫他們違反了村裏的規矩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:27.80,0:17:28.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你想死嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:29.40,0:17:31.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你再隨便胡來的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:31.40,0:17:33.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,就不是你一個人能承擔的了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:34.00,0:17:34.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:35.40,0:17:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛她自己之前不是已經答應過了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:38.80,0:17:39.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,那…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:40.70,0:17:42.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,只能這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:43.40,0:17:47.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,祈求山神的原諒 只能這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:48.40,0:17:49.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,這是爲了村子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:50.10,0:17:50.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你忍忍吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:53.10,0:17:53.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:56.20,0:17:58.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:08.90,0:18:11.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛 愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:15.80,0:18:16.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:17.30,0:18:18.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:28.50,0:18:29.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,喂 快填土
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:30.00,0:18:32.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎 開動手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:36.00,0:18:42.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎 贖去這六年你欺瞞山神的罪孽吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:42.70,0:18:44.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你必須贖罪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:45.50,0:18:46.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:46.90,0:18:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了村子 這樣下去大家都會餓死的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:57.60,0:18:59.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,求你了 仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:01.80,0:19:02.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:04.20,0:19:07.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,村子變成這樣都是你和愛的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:07.20,0:19:08.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,快點謝罪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:09.00,0:19:11.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,再沒有奶水的話 也活不下去幾天了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:12.70,0:19:13.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:14.70,0:19:15.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,爲了村子快動手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:18.40,0:19:19.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,動手吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:34.40,0:19:38.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我相信你會保護我的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:41.20,0:19:42.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我那麼相信你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:43.30,0:19:43.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,讓開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:44.90,0:19:46.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我們來填土
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:55.10,0:19:55.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:00.60,0:20:04.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山神 違反了規矩的女孩已經這樣了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:05.60,0:20:09.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,所以請救救村子 救救村子吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:12.90,0:20:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我恨你們 所有的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:18.40,0:20:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,死了也不放過你們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:12.40,0:21:13.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,着火了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:16.90,0:21:22.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,櫻樹之花 何時綻放
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:23.70,0:21:28.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,山麓莊中 何時綻放
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:25.90,0:21:26.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:29.30,0:21:34.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,櫻樹之花 何時芬芳
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:36.00,0:21:40.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,七子顏笑 玩耍時常
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:31.00,0:22:31.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,看到了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:33.30,0:22:33.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:39.50,0:22:40.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:41.30,0:22:43.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我不明白仙太郎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:46.30,0:22:47.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,我明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:49.50,0:22:50.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,明白
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:15.00,0:23:20.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て {\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:21.50,0:23:28.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}決{\K20}し{\K100}て {\K40}逃{\K45}げ{\K40}ら{\K40}れ{\K70}な{\K200}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:28.40,0:23:41.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}空{\K140}の{\K40}鳥{\K120}へ {\K40}哀{\K40}し{\K80}み{\K80}の{\K200}せ {\K100}飛{\K40}ば{\K80}す{\K200}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:45.50,0:23:48.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K50}ここ{\K140}は{\K20}仮{\K70}縫{\K70}い
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:49.30,0:23:59.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K210}私{\K180}を{\K60\K100}縛{\K60}る{\K30\K140}永{\K200}遠
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:00.30,0:24:06.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K80}行{\K20}き{\K100}も{\K30\K100}帰{\K80}り{\K200}も
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:07.30,0:24:19.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}過{\K30}ぎ{\K40}て{\K40\K240}ゆ{\K220}く{\K220}は{\K100}夢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:30.00,0:24:32.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,本故事純屬虛構\N登場人物名 團體名等全部與現實無關
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:32.70,0:24:35.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:37.00,0:24:38.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,將那紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:40.40,0:24:41.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:41.80,0:24:43.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:43.80,0:24:46.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,你自身也要付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:48.20,0:24:50.80,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:52.70,0:24:54.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,已經明白了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:55.40,0:24:58.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,來 之後的事 就由你自己抉擇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:59.90,0:25:00.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:56.94,0:25:01.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\an7\c&H0000FF&}下集
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:56.94,0:25:01.94,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}試縫
